Spicetify UI
============

This application is an unofficial front-end for the Spicetify CLI.

Spicetify CLI
-------------
This application does NOT bundle, redistribute, fork, or recompile the
Spicetify CLI. The CLI is a separate, user-installed dependency that this
application invokes as an external process.

